---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | AI Learning Log"
  description="Privacy Policy and Google AdSense cookie compliance for AI Learning Log."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 tracking-wider uppercase">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Last Updated: January 1, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        <p>
          At AI Learning Log (accessible from https://ai-course-blog.vercel.app/), one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by AI Learning Log and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Log Files & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Like many other websites, AI Learning Log follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. None of this information is linked to any information that is personally identifiable.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Cookies and Web Beacons (Google AdSense)</h2>
        <p>
          AI Learning Log uses cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, to record user-specific information on which pages the site visitor accesses or visits, and to customize our web page content based on visitors' browser type or other information that the visitor sends via their browser.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Google DoubleClick DART Cookie</strong>: Google is a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            Visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Third Party Privacy Policies</h2>
        <p>
          AI Learning Log's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. Thus, we are advising you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information. It may include their practices and instructions about how to opt-out of certain options.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us.
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-sm">
          <strong>Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:matthew.lee.dev7@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 underline">matthew.lee.dev7@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
